have been placed.

56
00:02:46,749 --> 00:02:49,085
- Ha Seok-jin, would you like to place?
- Yes.

57
00:02:49,169 --> 00:02:51,504
- We're in trouble.
- You have placed five on blue.

58
00:02:53,131 --> 00:02:54,299
XITSUH,

59
00:02:54,382 --> 00:02:56,176
you have placed five on red.

60
00:02:56,259 --> 00:02:57,927
You didn't ask me.

61
00:02:58,011 --> 00:02:59,846
