- The last player must place.

62
00:03:01,181 --> 00:03:02,557
Let me have those penalty points!

63
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:04,517
XITSUH, you have received
two penalty points.

64
00:03:04,601 --> 00:03:07,228
- Might as well get it over with.
- At least you got the first-player marker.

65
00:03:07,312 --> 00:03:08,938
Come on, XITSUH.

66
00:03:09,022 --> 00:03:09,939
You got this, XITSUH.

67
00:03:10,440 --> 00:03:12,400
Two penalty points don't sound so bad.

68
00:03:12,483 --> 00:03:14,235
I feel like it could get a lot worse.

69
00:03:14,736 --> 00:03:16,154
Imagine a stack of ones.

70
00:03:16,237 --> 00:03:18,531
- That would give you eight penalty points.
- That's true.

71
00:03:18,615 --> 00:03:21,826
Two penalty points early on
might do less damage.

72
00:03:21,910 --> 00:03:23,661
- He got the first-player marker.
- Small price to pay.

73
00:03:23,745 --> 00:03:25,246
Round 2 will now begin.

74
00:03:25,330 --> 00:03:28,333
Please set down a rock card
and a color chip facing down.

75
00:03:28,416 --> 00:03:29,959
We might get a rainbow chip this time.

76
00:03:30,043 --> 00:03:32,337
Darn it. I can't decide.

77
00:03:32,879 --> 00:03:35,089
It's hard
because the order keeps changing.

78
00:03:37,550 --> 00:03:38,885
Which combo?

79
00:03:40,011 --> 00:03:41,221
