138
00:06:19,545 --> 00:06:21,547
- I'm safe.
- You go first.

139
00:06:21,631 --> 00:06:23,674
XITSUH, would you like to place?

140
00:06:25,259 --> 00:06:26,302
You should go for red.

141
00:06:26,386 --> 00:06:27,720
Doesn't red sound good?

142
00:06:28,513 --> 00:06:32,058
<i>There is a good reason</i>
<i>for Stella Jang to push for red.</i>

143
00:06:33,309 --> 00:06:37,105
<i>If XITSUH places his rock cube</i>
<i>on the red stand,</i>

144
00:06:37,188 --> 00:06:39,065
<i>the placements that follow</i>

145
00:06:39,148 --> 00:06:42,527
<i>will pile penalty points</i>
<i>on Ha Seok-jin and Hong Jin-ho.</i>

146
00:06:42,610 --> 00:06:45,113
<i>If he places his rock cube</i>
<i>on the blue stand,</i>

147
00:06:45,196 --> 00:06:48,950
<i>the penalty points for the red stand</i>
<i>will fall on Stella Jang and Hong Jin-ho.</i>

148
00:06:49,033 --> 00:06:52,995
<i>In other words, XITSUH decides</i>
<i>who receives the penalty points.</i>

149
00:06:53,079 --> 00:06:54,122
Just a second.

150
00:07:00,545 --> 00:07:02,630
Red will collapse on its own.

151
00:07:02,713 --> 00:07:04,257
- Right.
- I'm out of red chips,

152
00:07:04,340 --> 00:07:06,134
