It doesn't matter.

162
00:07:22,442 --> 00:07:24,360
- You're stuck with it.
- No one else used a blue chip.

163
00:07:25,736 --> 00:07:27,321
Damn it.

164
00:07:27,405 --> 00:07:29,824
- Ha Seok-jin, would you like to place?
- Yes.

165
00:07:29,907 --> 00:07:31,534
You have placed six on red.

166
00:07:32,118 --> 00:07:34,162
- I'll pass.
- You have used a pass.

167
00:07:34,245 --> 00:07:36,038
