Why not?

169
00:07:37,039 --> 00:07:38,749
I'd like to give it a try.

170
00:07:38,833 --> 00:07:40,334
- JAE JAE, you have used a pass.
- Yes.

171
00:07:40,418 --> 00:07:41,878
- I'll pass.
- You have used a pass.

172
00:07:41,961 --> 00:07:44,046
Hong Jin-ho, you have placed four on red.

173
00:07:44,839 --> 00:07:46,674
You have received three penalty points.

174
00:07:46,757 --> 00:07:49,051
Jeong Hyun-gyu,
you have placed four on red.

175
00:07:49,635 --> 00:07:51,846
JAE JAE, you have received
three penalty points.

176
00:07:51,929 --> 00:07:53,598
That's a lot.

177
00:07:53,681 --> 00:07:56,058
Stella Jang, you have received
two penalty points.

178
00:07:56,142 --> 00:07:58,561
John Park, you have placed six on blue.

179
00:07:58,644 --> 00:08:00,271
That concludes Round 3.

180
00:08:02,231 --> 00:08:03,441
Round 4 will now begin.

181
00:08:03,524 --> 00:08:06,486
The first-player marker
will go to Stella Jang.

182
00:08:06,569 --> 00:08:08,112
