193
00:08:34,680 --> 00:08:35,973
It's all about Hyun-gyu's number now.

194
00:08:40,728 --> 00:08:42,897
It's the worst. Damn it.

195
00:08:45,441 --> 00:08:47,151
John Park, would you like to place?

196
00:08:47,235 --> 00:08:48,361
Just a moment.

197
00:08:48,444 --> 00:08:49,737
Please don't come to red.

198
00:08:50,655 --> 00:08:51,822
I'll go with red.

199
00:08:52,532 --> 00:08:54,700
- You have placed three on red.
- Yes.

200
00:08:56,744 --> 00:08:59,205
Jeong Hyun-gyu,
you have placed five on green.

201
00:08:59,288 --> 00:09:00,122
I'll pass.

202
00:09:00,206 --> 00:09:01,874
- You have used a pass.
- Come on.

203
00:09:01,958 --> 00:09:04,168
JAE JAE, you have received
two penalty points.

204
00:09:04,252 --> 00:09:06,045
That's so annoying.

205
00:09:06,128 --> 00:09:07,505
